	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "SHOU HAN TYPE-C 16PIN 2MD(073) USB 2.0 receptacle. 12 pads, 4 plated shell slots, 2 NPTH. Land from the vendor drawing vectors, cross-checked against its printed dimensions and against the stock HCTL 16P land. Differs from stock: pad length 1.15 not 1.30, far shell slot 1.80 not 1.60. Shell slots carry F.Paste for pin-in-paste (intrusive reflow): shell legs are 0.8mm and never protrude even on the vendor's 0.8mm board, so barrel solder is the only retention mechanism. Tell the assembler not to strip these apertures. Shell-slot paste apertures are oversized by 0.1575mm per side (~15% overprint) to feed the barrel. Shell pads are solid-connected to the zone (no thermal relief) for retention and shield continuity.")
